Package: cpueTargeting
Title: Simulators for CPUE Targeting and Standardization
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Henning", "Winker", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "henning.winker@fao.org")
Description: Reproducible multispecies operating models for exploring spatial
    targeting and catch-per-unit-effort standardization. Includes the 2014
    multi-habitat cluster example, the four-species bathymetric Run 22 model,
    and a spatial and vertical longline tuna simulator with hook-depth proxy
    scenarios.
